&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://securitylabs.datadoghq.com/articles/container-security-fundamentals-part-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Container security fundamentals part 5: AppArmor and SELinux&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
